Phase 2 vocal separation engine
--------------------------------
Phase 2's VocalSeparationService is implemented by
PhaseCancellationVocalSeparationService (src/main/java/com/aikaraoke/service),
which uses the classic phase-cancellation / mid-side technique
(instrumental ≈ L - R) over PCM decoded via the JDK's built-in
javax.sound.sampled API. No third-party model, weights, or library are
bundled or invoked for this feature - it is pure Java using only the JDK
standard library, so no additional license applies.

This is NOT a neural source-separation model (e.g. Demucs, UVR). It is a
simplified, fully-local, dependency-free approximation documented in
VocalSeparationService's Javadoc. A future Phase would need to bundle and
license a real separation model (e.g. Demucs, MIT License,
https://github.com/facebookresearch/demucs) to improve separation quality;
that model is NOT included in this repository.

